## Laser Cost vs Oral and Topical Treatment Cost Over Time

Oral terbinafine is not glamorous. But as a financial and clinical comparison, it is difficult to argue against  for patients who can tolerate it.

A standard 3-month course of generic oral terbinafine costs approximately £60 to £120 depending on the pharmacy and geography. Clinical studies report mycological cure rates between 71 and 82% for oral terbinafine  higher than the meta-analysis average for laser therapy. Prescription-grade topical lacquers like Jublia cost significantly more, often £500 or above for a full course requiring daily application for up to 48 weeks, with cure rates that are generally lower than both laser and oral options.

The comparison table over time looks like this. Generic terbinafine: £60 to £120 for a full course, 3-month commitment, liver monitoring required for some patients, cure rates 71 to 82%. Laser (full course): £500 to £1,500, three to six sessions over three to six months, no systemic side effects, cure rates approximately 63% by meta-analysis. Prescription topical (e.g. Jublia): £500 for a full course, daily application for up to 48 weeks, lower cure rates than both alternatives.

Many people reading this have already tried <a href='/blog/toenail-fungus/toenail-fungus-home-remedies'>home remedies for toenail fungus</a> before reaching this point. That progression is common and does not change the cost comparison at the clinical treatment stage. What it does change is the conversation about patience: patients who have already spent a year on topical options are usually far more willing to invest in a faster route, even at higher cost.

The laser option earns its place in the comparison for specific patients: those who cannot safely take oral antifungals, those who have genuinely failed multiple oral courses, and those for whom the systemic side effect profile of oral medication is clinically unacceptable. For everyone else, the financial case requires a full view of all the options  which is exactly what the post on <a href='/blog/toenail-fungus/best-toenail-fungus-treatment'>best toenail fungus treatment</a> covers in detail.

